, Asumi reaches her own decision: \"When I grow up, I'm going to be a rocket pilot.\"\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Ghost","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Astronomy","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Seinen","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Space","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":20,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Afterlife","rank":20,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Twin Spica","english":"Twin Spica","native":"ふたつのスピカ","romaji":"Futatsu no Spica","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"我要上太空"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"麦穗星之梦"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"两颗Spica"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}